docs/library/05_数据中心设施/会议_OCP2025/2025 OCP Global Summit/Time Appliances Project/5B_2022_7537PrecisionT_未署名.pdf,7537 - Precision Time Protocol for AI Back-End Networks- Modeling and Deployment Insights.pdf,5,B,2022,未署名,M06/M13,"《7537 - Precision Time Protocol for AI Back-End Networks- Modeling and Deployment Insights.pdf》。标题页原文：Ahmad Byagowi, Turba.ai｜Amit Oren, Broadcom｜watch?v=m74zazYPwkY。**提取文本含数字行 17 条，以下为原文原句摘录**：8 x HBM4 (12.8Tbps) 102.4Tbps；Unlike RTT/2, OWL captures asymmetry (different paths/queuing in each direction) which is common in Clos/leaf-spine fabrics.；Collectives (e.g., ring/tree all-reduce) and MoE token routing are barrier-sensitive; tail OWL (p99/p99.9) often controls step；Microbursts (incast to a single ToR egress) can create millisecond-class queueing spikes that dominate p99 OWL.；Clock sync: Use PTP (IEEE 1588 / 802.1AS) with boundary/transparent clocks so both endpoints’ NIC PHCs are aligned；(nanosecond-scale). On Linux, this typically looks like ptp4l to discipline the PHC and phc2sys (or in-kernel methods) to align；• Model. A simple, conservative discrete-event model of a 3-hop path；(Host→ToR→Spine→ToR→Host), 200 GbE, cut-through-like switching.；• Probe packets: 128 B every 10 µs (5,000 probes over 50 ms).；• Mild: 10 flows × 1,000 jumbo frames (9,216 B) starting at 10 ms；– per-flow service time = 9,216 B × 8 / 200 Gb/s = 0.36864 ms, aggregate ≈ 3.686 ms backlog.；• Max/tail values track the expected aggregate service backlog (≈3.7 ms and ≈7.4 ms), demonstrating how a brief；burst can dominate p99 even in a “lossless/low-jitter” DC.；Change hops_fixed_s to match your fabric (e.g., 400/800 GbE, different switch pipelines, fiber length).。命中模块（按关键词密度判）：M09/M13。**读法与可信度声明：本条 summary 由 pipeline/auto_batch.py 从缓存文本中抽「标题页 + 原文数字行」据实生成，所引每一句均可在 cache/text/e3724751bb9a.txt 中原文查到，未作转述或推断；分数按 README 固化的「厂商会议演示版默认 5 分档、上 6 需命中缺口模块」尺度给出，**未做逐份精读**；正文字符不足 800 的按图片型幻灯片定 3 分（须走 contact.py 视觉读才有内容）。若云端审计认为本件值得更高分，请回原文复核后调整。**",2026-08-16,半自动
